lassName` or `style` to customize a checkbox field container. Use descendant data-attribute selectors to style the interactive checkbox state:"},"194":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-48","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop displays a minus icon to represent a partial selection state. This is useful for \"select all\" checkboxes when only some items in a collection are selected."},"195":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-49","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"CheckboxGroup supports validation states and error messages:"},"196":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-50","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"},"197":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-51","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"},"198":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-52","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#group-validation","content":"**`FieldError`**: Displays validation error text below the group"},"199":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-53","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#orientation","content":"Use `orientation=\"vertical\"` (default) to stack checkboxes, or `orientation=\"horizontal\"` to arrange them in a row."},"200":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-54","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"},"201":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-55","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"},"202":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-56","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#keyboard-navigation","content":"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"},"203":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-57","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"},"204":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-58","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-required` when selection is required"},"205":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-59","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"},"206":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-60","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#aria-support","content":"Proper labeling with `aria-labelledby` and `aria-describedby`"},"207":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-61","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#indeterminate-state-not-updating","content":"The `isIndeterminate` prop must be explicitly managed - it doesn't automatically reflect parent-child relationships:"},"208":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-62","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ For selecting multiple independent options"},"209":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-63","page_id":"/docs/components/checkbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/checkbox#when-to-use-checkboxes","content":"✅ When users can select zero, one, or many items"},"210":{"id":"/docs/components/checkbox-64","page_id":"/d