-removal","content":"Selection and removal"},"241":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-17","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#layout-and-sizing","content":"Layout and sizing"},"242":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-18","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#button-composition","content":"Button composition"},"243":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-19","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"244":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-20","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"245":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-21","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#troubleshooting","content":"Troubleshooting"},"246":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-22","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#a-chipgroup-has-no-accessible-name","content":"A ChipGroup has no accessible name"},"247":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-23","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#the-remove-action-does-not-update-the-ui","content":"The remove action does not update the UI"},"248":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-24","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#a-composed-label-is-not-truncating-correctly","content":"A composed label is not truncating correctly"},"249":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-25","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#the-menu-trigger-does-not-look-like-a-chip","content":"The menu trigger does not look like a Chip"},"250":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-26","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#props","content":"Props"},"251":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-27","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chip","content":"Chip"},"252":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-28","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chipgroup","content":"ChipGroup"},"253":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-29","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chiplist","content":"ChipList"},"254":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-30","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/chip#chipbutton","content":"ChipButton"},"255":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-31","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"},"256":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-32","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Toggle Chips for selecting multiple peer filters"},"257":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-33","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Removable Chips for user-added filters and input tokens"},"258":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-34","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"Shared `sm`, `md`, and `lg` sizes, with optional leading icons"},"259":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-35","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#features","content":"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"},"260":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-36","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#default","content":"Start with a labeled group of related values. Add selection or removal when\nthe group needs interactive behavior."},"261":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-37","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#toggle-chips","content":"Use Toggle Chips for multiple peer filters. The Chip render prop supplies\nselection state for the checkmark, while `textValue` names composed content."},"262":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-38","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#removable-chips","content":"Use Removable Chips for user-added filters and tokens. `ChipGroup` reports\nremoved keys through `onRemove`; the owner updates its collection. A\nself-closing `Button` in the `remove` slot supplies each remove control."},"263":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-39","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#controlled-selection","content":"Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` when another part of the page\nneeds to own the selected filter state."},"264":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-40","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#sizes","content":"Compare the supported `sm`, `md`, and `lg` sizes. Set `size` on `ChipGroup`\nso every Chip inherits one consistent size."},"265":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-41","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#disabled","content":"Disable individual options with `disabledKeys` when some values are unavailable."},"266":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-42","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#truncation","content":"By default, long labels truncate visually when space is constrained, while\nthe complete accessible value remains available."},"267":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-43","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#empty-state","content":"Give an empty collection useful guidance, then let the user add the first\nvalue. Removable items continue to be owned by the collection."},"268":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-44","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#menu-filter-trigger","content":"Use `ChipButton` for Chip presentation without collection semantics.\n`MenuTrigger` continues to own open state, focus, and keyboard behavior."},"269":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-45","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#content","content":"Use a string for a simple label. For icons or other composed content, wrap the\nvisible label in `Text` and provide `textValue` for the accessible name. See\n**Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips** above."},"270":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-46","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#selection-and-removal","content":"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."},"271":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-47","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#layout-and-sizing","content":"Set `size` on `ChipGroup` to keep a collection consistent. `ChipList` wraps by\ndefault and accepts layout props for custom arrangements. See **Sizes**."},"272":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-48","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#button-composition","content":"Use `ChipButton` when Chip presentation is needed without collection semantics.\nCompose it with components such as `MenuTrigger`; those components continue to\nown open state, focus, and keyboard behavior. See **Menu filter trigger**."},"273":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-49","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use `Label` or `aria-label` to name the `ChipGroup`; this names the collection,\nnot its individual Chips."},"274":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-50","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Give each Chip a visible label, `textValue`, or `aria-label`. Use `textValue`\nwhen a Chip contains icons, composed content, or a render prop."},"275":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-51","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Use a descriptive group label so removal actions can be announced clearly."},"276":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-52","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"Keep the visible label and the accessible value synchronized."},"277":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-53","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#accessibility","content":"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."},"278":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-54","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Keep labels concise and let them truncate only when the available width requires it."},"279":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-55","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Prefer groups of three or more related values."},"280":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-56","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Keep one size per group."},"281":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-57","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/chip#best-practices","content":"Let `ChipList` wrap instead of forcing a single horizontal line."},"282":{"id":"/docs/components/chip-58","page_id":"/docs/components/chip","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/com