nter\">`"],[1917,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[1915,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[1919,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[1871,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[493,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1459,"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."],[1008,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1215,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[310,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[203,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[1009,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1216,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[205,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1011,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1538,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1217,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[309,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[957,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[204,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[1010,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[307,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[955,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[954,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value"],[306,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[956,"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"],[308,"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string 