h share an index so an actual line and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."],[1056,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[571,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[574,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[570,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[572,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[573,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[575,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1331,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[336,"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"],[413,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[901,"`Enter/Space`"],[455,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[660,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[422,"`Escape`"],[798,"`Escape`"],[903,"`Escape`"],[1616,"`Escape`"],[492,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."],[1900,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[579,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[1938,"`Grid` is a two-dimensional CSS Grid layout component for complex grid-based layouts. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[632,"`Heading` renders a semantic `h1`-`h6` element via the `level` prop.\nInside a `Modal`/`Dialog`, add `slot=\"title\"` and it labels the dialog automatically."],[648,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a thin wrapper over RAC `DisclosurePanel` that hides when collapsed. The trigger is any component you slot in with `slot=\"trigger\"` — there's no dedicated trigger component."],[693,"`Input` is the single-line control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` or `NumberField` as the parent; see those components for fuller examples."],[1814,"`legendPosition` puts the legend above or below the plot, or hides it with `null`. Multi-series charts get a bottom legend by default."],[1869,"`lg` - Large spacing"],[722,"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."],[1868,"`md` - Medium spacing"],[757,"`MenuTrigger` exposes its open state via `isOpen`/`onOpenChange`,\nwhich can be used to drive the rotation of a chevron icon."],[76,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[339,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[793,"`Modal` accepts `isOpen` and `onOpenChange` directly, so it can be controlled without a\n`ModalTrigger`. Useful when the modal is opened from several places at once."],[789,"`ModalTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Modal>`, handling open state automatically. Based on RAC `DialogTrigger`."],[1055,"`orientation` switches between `horizontal` (accent bar on top) and `vertical` (accent bar on the leading edge)."],[1666,"`orientation=\"horizontal\"` swaps the axes: categories run down the side and values across the bottom. Reach for it when the labels are long or the chart is really 