e styled as a period-over-period comparison card. Paired series\n(solid current period + dashed previous period) share a `colorIndex`; hovering either\nline shows both dated values and the percent change, wrapped in the default popover."],[1832,"`renderTooltip` lets you render a fully custom tooltip and know which curve is\nhovered. Paired series share a `colorIndex`; hovering either line shows a\ntooltip specific to that line, wrapped in the default styled popover."],[800,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[905,"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"],[426,"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"],[578,"`role=\"img\"`: When title prop is provided"],[577,"`role=\"presentation\"`: For decorative icons"],[305,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[953,"`role=\"progressbar\"` on the container"],[1007,"`role=\"radio\"` on each option"],[1214,"`role=\"radio\"` on each segment"],[1006,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1213,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1537,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"],[1536,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"],[763,"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."],[1457,"`size` is the tier: the eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`,\nand the body on `body`. Use `2xl` for a page title, `xl` for a hero, `lg` for a section\ntitle, and `md` (the default) everywhere else."],[631,"`slot=\"title\"` inside a `Modal` or `Dialog` sets the accessible name."],[1867,"`sm` - Small spacing"],[46,"`Space` / `Enter`"],[1357,"`Space` toggles the switch when it has focus"],[1057,"`status` is independent of timeline and o